      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TOURIGA (8) broke a four start winning streak with a minor placing (34.98) last time at Cannington. Looks the testing material here. MAX CAPACITY (1) wound up strongly to place two back then did the same last time, finishing on late when third (35.04) in a Grade 4/5 at Cannington. Has a good record here including six wins. Goes very well from this draw with four wins and three minor placings from nine starts. Winning chance. LIGHTNING BYTE (6) was a last start winner this course and distance taking a Grade 5 in 37.66 in the best time on the card and clocking a personal best as well. In form and looks a leading player again. FERNDALE FLYER (4) was strongly fancied last time but finished second (37.70), beaten half a length. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Overdue and expected to feature again.",
